⚡ 2. Features of Java

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔹 Platform Independent

✔ Runs on any OS using JVM

---

🔹 Object-Oriented

✔ Uses concepts like:

* Class
* Object
* Inheritance
* Polymorphism

---

🔹 Simple

✔ Easy syntax compared to C++

---

🔹 Secure

✔ No direct memory access
✔ Bytecode verification

---

🔹 Robust

✔ Strong memory management
✔ Exception handling

---

🔹 Multithreaded

✔ Supports multiple tasks at once

---

🔹 High Performance

✔ Uses Just-In-Time (JIT) compiler

